  42:dependencies/cycfi/q/q_lib/include/q/fx/differentiator.hpp ****    // signal's derivative than the first-difference. It is calculated by
  43:dependencies/cycfi/q/q_lib/include/q/fx/differentiator.hpp ****    // subtracting two samples, one in the positive direction and one in the
